    {
      "command_point_cost": 1,
      "effect_text": "Resolve the following sequence:\n1. Select one enemy unit engaged with your unit.\n2. Select one model in your unit engaged with that enemy unit.\n3. Roll a number of D6 equal to the T characteristic of that model: for each 1, your unit suffers 1 mortal wound; for each 5+, that enemy unit suffers 1 mortal wound (to a maximum of 6 mortal wounds per unit)",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "core-v2-p15d-source-review:crushing-impact",
