      "source_text": "15.05 Crushing Impact\nCrushing Impact\nCharge Phase\nTARGET\nThat MONSTER/VEHICLE unit\nWHEN\nYour Charge phase, just after a friendly MONSTER/VEHICLE unit ends a charge move.\nEFFECT\nResolve the following sequence:\n1. Select one enemy unit engaged with your unit.\n2. Select one model in your unit engaged with that enemy unit.\n3. Roll a number of D6 equal to the T characteristic of that model: for each 1, your unit suffers 1 mortal wound; for each 5+, that enemy unit suffers 1 mortal wound (to a maximum of 6 mortal wounds per unit)\n1 CP",
      "target_text": "That MONSTER/VEHICLE unit",
      "title": "Crushing Impact",
      "transcription_sha256": "63fe27d984e7863a906d1ff7edeaef678fa69cdc1c6a7040869409749353e060",
      "when_text": "Your Charge phase, just after a friendly MONSTER/VEHICLE unit ends a charge move."
    },
    {
      "command_point_cost": 1,
      "effect_text": "Resolve the following sequence: 1. Select one EXPLOSIVES/GRENADES model in your unit. 2. Select one unengaged enemy unit within 8\" of and visible to that model. 3. Roll six D6: for each 4+, that enemy unit suffers 1 mortal wound (06.02).",
